{"nusach":"ashkenaz","id":"havdalah","sections":[{"title":{"he":"פסוקי ההבדלה","en":"Opening Verses"},"segments":[{"key":"46uLt83zTV","he":[[{"t":"במוצאי יום הכיפורים שחל בחול אין אומרים את הפסוקים, ומתחילים מהברכה על היין","s":"n"}]],"en":"When Yom Kippur ends on a weekday, the verses are omitted and Havdalah begins with the blessing over the wine.","when":{"all":["dayAfterYomKippur"],"none":["tishaBav","motzaeiShabbat"]}},{"key":"uuYJPkieQn","he":[[{"t":"הִנֵּה, אֵל יְשׁוּעָתִי אֶבְטַח, וְלֹא אֶפְחָד, כִּי עָזִּי וְזִמְרָת יָהּ, יְהֹוָה, וַיְהִי לִי לִישׁוּעָה, וּשְׁאַבְתֶּם מַֽיִם בְּשָׂשׂוֹן, מִמַּעַיְנֵי הַיְשׁוּעָה:"}]],"en":"Behold! The Almighty is my deliverance— I will trust in Him and will not fear; for the strength and retribution of God Adonoy was the cause of my deliverance. And you will draw water with joy, from the wellsprings of deliverance.","when":{"none":["tishaBav"]}},{"key":"oEIK07PogR","he":[[{"t":"לַיהֹוָה הַיְשׁוּעָה, עַל עַמְּ֒ךָ בִרְכָתֶךָ סֶּֽלָה:"}]],"en":"To Adonoy belongs deliverance upon Your people is Your blessing, selah.","when":{"none":["tishaBav"]}},{"key":"VqjJom_pdP","he":[[{"t":"יְהֹוָה צְבָאוֹת עִמָּֽנוּ מִשְׂגָּב לָֽנוּ אֱלֹהֵי יַעֲקֹב סֶֽלָה:"}]],"en":"Adonoy of Hosts is with us a stronghold for us is the God of Jacob, selah.","when":{"none":["tishaBav"]}},{"key":"Lhgy3A3E4h","he":[[{"t":"יְהֹוָה צְבָאוֹת אַשְׁרֵי אָדָם בּוֹטֵֽחַ בָּךְ:"}]],"en":"Adonoy of hosts, fortunate is the man who trusts in You.","when":{"none":["tishaBav"]}},{"key":"xBNwkHHonK","he":[[{"t":"יְהֹוָה הוֹשִֽׁיעָה הַמֶּֽלֶךְ יַעַנֵֽנוּ בְיוֹם קָרְאֵֽנוּ:"}]],"en":"Adonoy, deliver [us,] the King will answer us on the day we call.","when":{"none":["tishaBav"]}},{"key":"eCplWLBq2y","he":[[{"t":"לַיְהוּדִים הָיְ֒תָה אוֹרָה וְשִׂמְחָה, וְשָׂשׂוֹן וִיקָר:"}]],"en":"For the Jews there was light and joy, gladness and honor.","when":{"none":["tishaBav"]}},{"key":"1nx9ZS_mm3","he":[[{"t":"כֵּן תִּהְיֶה לָּֽנוּ:"}]],"en":"So be it with us.","when":{"none":["tishaBav"]}},{"key":"GCs9Hhgpw9","he":[[{"t":"כּוֹס יְשׁוּעוֹת אֶשָּׂא, וּבְשֵׁם יְהֹוָה אֶקְרָא:"}]],"en":"The cup of deliverance, I will raise and upon the Name, Adonoy, will I call.","when":{"none":["tishaBav"]}}]},{"title":{"he":"על היין","en":"Over the Wine"},"segments":[{"key":"FpkY8zBFS_","he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה, אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם, בּוֹרֵא פְּרִי הַגָּֽפֶן:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy, our God, King of the Universe, Creator of the fruit of the vine.","when":{"none":["tishaBav"]}}]},{"title":{"he":"על הבשמים","en":"Over the Spices"},"segments":[{"key":"Hn6Ct6-iU4","he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה, אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם, בּוֹרֵא מִינֵי בְשָׂמִים:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy, our God, King of the Universe, Creator of the kinds of spices.","when":{"any":["motzaeiShabbat"],"none":["tishaBav"]}}]},{"title":{"he":"על הנר","en":"Over the Flame"},"segments":[{"key":"46uLt83zTV.1","he":[[{"t":"במוצאי יום הכיפורים מברכים על נר ששבת, שדלק מערב יום הכיפורים","s":"n"}]],"en":"At the conclusion of Yom Kippur, the blessing is said over a flame that has burned since before Yom Kippur.","when":{"any":["dayAfterYomKippur","motzaeiShabbat"],"all":["dayAfterYomKippur"]}},{"key":"cQWBUdpMlV","he":[[{"t":"במוצאי שבת שחל בו תשעה באב מברכים הלילה רק על הנר, ואת ההבדלה על הכוס אומרים בצאת הצום בלי בשמים ובלי נר","s":"n"}]],"en":"When Tisha B’Av begins at the end of Shabbat, only the blessing over the flame is said tonight. Havdalah over the cup is said when the fast ends, without spices or flame.","when":{"any":["dayAfterYomKippur","motzaeiShabbat"],"all":["tishaBav"]}},{"key":"ZQWG6j1q9p","he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה, אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם, בּוֹרֵא מְאוֹרֵי הָאֵשׁ:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy, our God, King of the Universe Creator of the lights of fire.","when":{"any":["dayAfterYomKippur","motzaeiShabbat"]}}]},{"title":{"he":"ברכת המבדיל","en":"The Havdalah Blessing"},"segments":[{"key":"JBErGYNn-h","he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה, אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם, הַמַּבְדִּיל בֵּין קֹֽדֶשׁ לְחוֹל, בֵּין אוֹר לְחֽשֶׁךְ, בֵּין יִשְׂרָאֵל לָעַמִּים, בֵּין יוֹם הַשְּׁ֒בִיעִי לְשֵֽׁשֶׁת יְמֵי הַמַּעֲשֶׂה, בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה, הַמַּבְדִּיל בֵּין קֽדֶשׁ לְחוֹל:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy, our God, King of the Universe, Who makes distinction between sacred and unhallowed, between light and darkness, between Israel and the peoples, between the seventh day and the six work days. Blessed are You, Adonoy, Who makes distinction between sacred and unhallowed.","when":{"none":["tishaBav"]}}]}],"credits":[{"title":"Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear — The Metsudah Siddur (1981)","license":"CC-BY","url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Shabbat_Siddur_Sefard_Linear"}]}